Package: dnsnft
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: atrivisc <atrivisc@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.54~)
Recommends: nftables
Homepage: https://github.com/atrivisc/dnsnft
Description: fill nftables sets from DNS answers
 dnsnft reads DNS responses from an NFQUEUE and adds the resolved
 addresses of listed domains to nftables sets, with timeouts derived
 from the record TTLs.
